        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Hey hey, come on over and have some fun with Crrrrrazy Taxi! Barrel through traffic packed streets, hurdle off parking garages, and Crazy Combo your way to Crazy Money in a wild frantic race to scare up the most fares. In Crazy Taxi, time is money, and only the Craziest Cabbies come out victorious.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¡Eh, ven a divertirte con Crrrrrazy Taxi! Atraviesa a toda velocidad calles llenas de tráfico, salta desde los estacionamientos y consigue Crazy Combos para llegar a Crazy Money en una frenética carrera por recoger la mayor cantidad de pasajeros. En Crazy Taxi, el tiempo es dinero, y solo los taxistas más locos salen victoriosos.",
          "source": "claude",
