          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "After New York, what city could be screwy enough for a CRAZY TAXI game? You guessed it, an amped-up version of Las Vegas serves as the backdrop for this chapter in this ultra-tense driving game. As with previous series installments, the object of the game is to collect as much fare money as possible by picking up and delivering passengers at record speeds. You'll have to create a few shortcuts of your won in order to win, and that will mean causing a few crashes and knocking down a few buildings.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Después de Nueva York, ¿qué ciudad podría ser lo bastante loca para un juego de CRAZY TAXI? Adivinaste: una versión exagerada de Las Vegas sirve de escenario para esta entrega de este juego de conducción sumamente tenso. Como en las entregas anteriores de la serie, el objetivo es reunir la mayor cantidad de dinero de las tarifas posible recogiendo y entregando pasajeros a velocidades récord. Deberás crear algunos atajos propios para ganar, lo que implicará provocar algunos choques y derribar algunos edificios.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2002",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
